WEBVTT

00:06:54.952 --> 00:07:00.291
In our groups, men, women and children
reconnect with their bodies,

00:07:00.332 --> 00:07:03.836
have the space to express
what they are feeling,

00:07:03.878 --> 00:07:05.629
and most importantly,

00:07:05.671 --> 00:07:07.673
reconnect with others.

00:07:08.299 --> 00:07:11.177
We use art, mindfulness,

00:07:11.218 --> 00:07:13.220
dance and storytelling

00:07:13.262 --> 00:07:18.476
to help make sense of the dislocating
experiences of violence

00:07:18.517 --> 00:07:21.103
and of being forced to leave your home.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:26.108
And everything that we do
is underpinned by value-based practice.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:30.279
We practice understanding, curiosity